<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#030712] pt-24">
    
    <!-- PAGE HERO -->
    <section class="py-16 tech-grid-bg relative">
        <div class="glow-orb glow-orb-cyan top-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 opacity-40"></div>

        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10 space-y-4 reveal">
            <span class="tech-badge">Soluções Corporativas Em TI</span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-gradient-cyan">
                Serviços e Inteligência em TI
            </h1>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Projetos de infraestrutura robustos e consultoria estratégica para empresas que necessitam de estabilidade contínua.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SERVICES GRID -->
    <section class="py-16 relative">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                
                <!-- Service 1 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            ⚡
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
                            Infraestrutura & Redes
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Projetamos e gerenciamos a espinha dorsal da sua comunicação corporativa, garantindo máxima taxa de transferência e estabilidade de conexão.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300">Cabeamento Estruturado</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300">Wi-Fi 6 Corporativo</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300">Switches & Roteadores</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 2 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            🛡️
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">
                            Gestão de Servidores & Backup
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Controle total de ambientes locais e virtuais. Estratégias de backup híbrido para proteção absoluta contra desastres e sequestro de dados (Ransomware).
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-300">Windows / Linux</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-300">Backup Imutável em Nuvem</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-300">Recuperação de Desastres</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 3 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            🖥️
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">
                            Montagem & Hardware
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Consultoria técnica especializada para especificação e montagem de estações de trabalho e servidores sob medida para cargas de processamento intensas.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300">Workstations de Alta Performance</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300">Upgrades Estratégicos</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 4 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            🔒
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">
                            Segurança & LGPD
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Implementação de camadas de segurança corporativa, política de controle de acesso (MFA/DLP) e adequação aos requerimentos técnicos da LGPD.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-300">Conformidade LGPD</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-300">Criptografia de Dados</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 5 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-rose-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            💼
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-rose-300 transition-colors">
                            Outsourcing de TI
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Gestão 360° da tecnologia da sua empresa. Transfira a responsabilidade de manutenção preventiva e suporte ao usuário para uma equipe dedicada.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-rose-500/20 text-rose-300">Gestão Preventiva NOC</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-rose-500/20 text-rose-300">Governança Digital</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 6 -->
                <div class="glass-card glass-card-glow flex flex-col justify-between reveal group">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
                            ☁️
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">
                            Cloud & Mobilidade
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Migração segura de infraestruturas físicas para nuvens híbridas (Azure/AWS) e viabilização de conexões VPN para home office produtivo.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">Azure / AWS</span>
                        <span class="text-xs py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">VPNs Criptografadas</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TECH STACK MULTI-PLATFORM -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-950/80 border-t border-white/10 relative">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10 reveal">
            <span class="tech-badge mb-4">Multi-Plataforma</span>
            <h2 class="section-title text-gradient-cyan">Expertise Técnica Completa</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-base max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
                Dominamos os ecossistemas mais consolidados do mercado para garantir integração fluida entre seus servidores, estações de trabalho e ambientes na nuvem.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Windows Server</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Linux Debian/RHEL</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">macOS / iOS</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Android Enterprise</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Microsoft 365</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-card bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all text-center">
                    <span class="block font-heading font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm">Google Workspace</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
